Package: vale
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: syntax-aware linter for prose
 vale lints prose in Markdown, reStructuredText, AsciiDoc, HTML and
 source-code comments against configurable style rules. Editorial
 styles (write-good, Microsoft, Google, ...) load from a styles
 directory; everything is driven by a .vale.ini.
